# COSBEL Ltd

> COSBEL Ltd is an electrical engineering company based in Kimironko, Gasabo, Kigali, Rwanda. We design, install, manufacture and commission power-supply and power-distribution systems for factories and industrial sites, and we inspect existing electrical equipment such as transformers. We also carry out residential and commercial electrical work.

## Pages

- [Home](https://cosbel.example/): overview of the company and its main services.
- [Services](https://cosbel.example/services): the full list of electrical engineering services.
- [Industrial Electrical Services](https://cosbel.example/services/industrial-electrical-services): Electrical engineering for factories and industrial sites.
- [Compact Substations & Transformer Installation](https://cosbel.example/services/compact-substations-and-transformers): Supply and installation of compact substations and transformers, including the full HV/LV chain.
- [Underground Cabling](https://cosbel.example/services/underground-cabling): Underground power cables between substations, boards, generators and existing supply lines.
- [ATS & Generator Systems](https://cosbel.example/services/ats-and-generator-systems): Generator integration and transfer switches so backup power engages without a hitch.
- [Industrial Equipment Installation & Commissioning](https://cosbel.example/services/industrial-equipment-commissioning): Installation and commissioning of industrial equipment with its own power infrastructure.
- [Power Distribution System Design](https://cosbel.example/services/power-distribution-design): Engineering design for how a facility is supplied from one or more sources, with generator backup.
- [Transformer Inspection & Testing](https://cosbel.example/services/transformer-inspection-and-testing): Formal inspection reports on the condition of your transformers and electrical equipment.
- [Residential Electrical Services](https://cosbel.example/services/residential-electrical-services): Safe, tidy electrical work for homes and households.
- [Commercial Electrical Installations](https://cosbel.example/services/commercial-electrical-installations): Electrical installations for offices and business premises.
- [Electrical Installation and Maintenance](https://cosbel.example/services/installation-and-maintenance): Installation and ongoing maintenance of electrical systems.
- [About](https://cosbel.example/about): who we are, how we work, and answers to common questions.
- [Projects](https://cosbel.example/projects): selected projects across design, installation, commissioning and inspection.
- [Contact](https://cosbel.example/contact): phone +250 788 312 434, email, address and the quote-request form.

## Frequently asked questions

- [Where does COSBEL Ltd work?](https://cosbel.example/about): We are based in Kimironko, Gasabo, Kigali and take on projects across Rwanda.
- [Do you work on homes as well as factories?](https://cosbel.example/about): Yes. Our core work is industrial and commercial, but we also carry out residential electrical installation and maintenance.
- [Can you install a compact substation or transformer?](https://cosbel.example/about): Yes. We supply and install compact substations and distribution transformers, including the high-voltage to low-voltage chain: ring main units, breakers, protection and metering.
- [Can you connect a generator to our existing supply?](https://cosbel.example/about): Yes. We integrate generators through automatic transfer switches and interlocked changeovers, designed so that two sources are never connected together.
- [Do you manufacture ATS units?](https://cosbel.example/about): We design and manufacture our own manual ATS units, including installations that manage several generators.
- [Can you inspect our transformer or electrical equipment?](https://cosbel.example/about): Yes. We inspect existing equipment such as transformers and deliver formal condition reports.
- [Do you provide documentation when a job is finished?](https://cosbel.example/about): Every project is handed over with completion certificates and inspection reports on COSBEL-branded documents.
- [How do we get a quote?](https://cosbel.example/about): Call +250 788 312 434, email us, or send the request form on our contact page and we will come back to you.
